#8205
The Great Cabin~
This room is dominated by a large conference table bolted to the floor in the
aft of the room.  On this side of the room, you see a small table, a bunk and
a bookshelf bolted to the floor.  Just inside the door, you notice a small
shrine to the sea god, Neptune.  On the floor, under the bed is a small chest.
To the fore of the room is the doorway to the poop deck and the room extends
to the aft.
