#8210
In The Forecastle~
This room contains mostly canvas although the foreward mast rises from the
floor travels up through the ceiling.  Wear and tear on the sails keeps the
sailors busy sewing and patching by the light of the decklight grating above.
Along with this, barrels of tar and other gear need for repairs to the ship
are lined against the walls.  To the aft is the doorway to the main deck and
there is a door to the port side of the room.
