#8271
Firewood Storage Area~
Stored on the bulkheads is a huge supply of firewood.  It's obvious this ship
is preparing for a voyage on the open sea. If they were going to be traveling
on a river or coastline excursion, they would devote most of this area to
cargo storage and send sailors ashore to cut wood every few days.  The galley
area is starboard of here.
~
