#8272
The Galley~
The galley has a stone fireplace for cooking that can be dismantled and
stored when the sailing get rough.  A kettle hangs from an iron hook that can
be swung over the fire.  The food preparation area is starboard, you see a
huge supply of firewood to port and all the food is stored foreward from
here.  An open section of deck to the aft is used as a mess area.
~
